# Mayhoa Skyhoof's Prairie Wolf Pup Carrier in Orgrimmar (new in Forever).
# Sources: NPC 268745 (position); Forever client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse
# prices; every pet item teaches its companion when used).

step Mayhoa Skyhoof
  tip Mayhoa Skyhoof walks a long loop through Orgrimmar (from the Valley of Strength to the Drag); the waypoint is one point on her path. The carrier costs 60s. Each pet item teaches its companion when you use it; the goals stay ticked afterwards.
  vendor 268745 "Mayhoa Skyhoof" @49.4,34.8 live
  buy 277508 "Prairie Wolf Pup Carrier" npc 268745 optional -- 60s
